01:35.710 --> 01:40.560
God, please save Grandpa and Grandma.

01:40.560 --> 01:42.020
I...

01:42.960 --> 01:46.540
I will endure whatever trial awaits me.

01:49.080 --> 01:54.220
So please, grant my wish, God...

01:55.710 --> 01:56.900
God!

01:58.150 --> 02:00.250
God!

02:24.140 --> 02:26.710
He lost both of them at the same time.

02:26.710 --> 02:28.140
Poor boy.

02:29.480 --> 02:32.370
He doesn't have any relatives, does he?

02:35.490 --> 02:38.410
I wonder what'll happen to him.

02:38.410 --> 02:40.180
Santana...

02:49.680 --> 02:50.910
Amen.

03:01.700 --> 03:02.700
Carlos.

03:05.160 --> 03:06.660
Carlos.

03:06.660 --> 03:08.700
Carlos.

03:10.020 --> 03:12.540
Grandpa, Grandma!

03:38.680 --> 03:40.430
Idiot...

03:40.430 --> 03:43.380
Idiot!

03:46.560 --> 03:48.020
Santana!

03:48.940 --> 03:50.220
Santana!

03:56.500 --> 04:01.660
<b>The Son of God, Santana</b>

03:56.500 --> 04:01.660
<b>The Son of God, Santana</b>

04:01.660 --> 04:11.740
Santana! Santana! Santana!

04:01.820 --> 04:05.460
Santa Familia Stadium

04:05.660 --> 04:07.230
The Son of God, Santana!

04:07.230 --> 04:09.660
Show them the power of Brazil!

04:14.310 --> 04:15.990
Son of God, you say?

04:17.510 --> 04:18.660
Me?

04:22.470 --> 04:24.720
I'm not the Son of God.

04:31.680 --> 04:33.900
I'm the Soccer Cyborg.

04:33.900 --> 04:35.830
Carlos Santana,

04:35.830 --> 04:39.140
a player who possesses both composure and technique.

04:39.750 --> 04:43.260
I'll finally play against you in the second half!

04:46.420 --> 04:50.420
Brancos vs Domingo, the second half is about to begin with score of 2-1.

04:50.420 --> 04:54.410
Will Tsubasa Ohzora lead the Brancos to victory?

04:54.410 --> 04:58.400
Or will Santana, the Son of God, make a comeback against Tsubasa?

05:09.220 --> 05:12.220
Tsubasa steals the ball and charges towards the Domingo goal!

05:12.220 --> 05:14.220
Yeah! Tsubasa! Go!

05:12.220 --> 05:14.220
There you go! That's good! Go for it!

05:26.990 --> 05:28.280
He's shooting!

05:28.280 --> 05:29.300
Don't let him!

05:33.510 --> 05:37.360
Incredible! He faked right and shot with his left!

05:38.820 --> 05:39.500
What?!

05:39.860 --> 05:41.740
Goal! 3-1!

05:42.910 --> 05:46.500
Tsubasa gets the rebound himself and scores!

05:46.500 --> 05:50.240
The young #10 of Brancos, Tsubasa, drives the ball in for a hat trick!

05:51.780 --> 05:56.980
Tsubasa is quite impressive as the first Japanese player to join the Brancos.

05:56.980 --> 06:00.740
Tsubasa understands his role within the team very well.

06:01.540 --> 06:02.740
Yes!

06:03.430 --> 06:04.740
Tsubasa.

06:04.740 --> 06:08.940
On the other hand, Domingo doesn't seem to be making full use of Santana.

06:08.940 --> 06:12.780
In any other game, Santana would've scored two or three goals by now.

06:14.530 --> 06:17.020
What happened to the Son of God, Santana?

06:17.020 --> 06:19.500
Will he succumb to Tsubasa without a fight?

06:19.500 --> 06:21.480
Leo, get ready.

06:21.480 --> 06:21.900
Yes.

06:21.900 --> 06:24.940
Do you understand your role?

06:24.940 --> 06:30.710
Of course, I've been Santana's partner since Bará FC Escolinha.

06:30.710 --> 06:32.170
Leave it to me.

06:33.890 --> 06:37.700
It happened when Santana and I were seven.

06:47.640 --> 06:49.580
Wow!

06:52.700 --> 06:55.190
Hey, hey, you!

06:55.190 --> 06:57.140
How can you control the ball so well?

06:57.540 --> 06:59.320
It's easy!

06:59.320 --> 07:01.500
You just have to become friends with the ball!

07:01.500 --> 07:03.180
Become friends with the ball?

07:04.410 --> 07:06.740
Yeah, the soccer ball is a friend.

07:13.410 --> 07:14.380
I'm Leo.

07:14.380 --> 07:15.870
I'm Carlos.

07:15.870 --> 07:17.580
Carlos Santana.

07:17.580 --> 07:18.950
Nice to meet you!

07:18.950 --> 07:20.280
Nice to meet you!

07:27.380 --> 07:29.260
One more time?

07:29.260 --> 07:30.600
Okay!

07:47.860 --> 07:52.260
Santana and I aren't only the ultimate duo.

07:52.740 --> 07:56.250
Ever since that day, I've considered him to be my best friend.

08:04.200 --> 08:08.700
Back then, Santana never made such a cold look.

08:13.100 --> 08:14.860
Let's go, Santana!

08:14.860 --> 08:16.140
Wonderful pass by Leo!

08:16.140 --> 08:18.100
Is Santana going for the direct shot?

08:17.540 --> 08:18.460
Get back!

08:23.980 --> 08:25.340
Santana...

08:31.260 --> 08:33.720
What's going on?

08:33.720 --> 08:37.380
Santana returns to the center circle while lifting the ball!

08:41.260 --> 08:43.620
What exactly is he...

08:43.620 --> 08:45.700
Why are you all just standing there?

08:45.700 --> 08:48.220
Go and steal the ball from Santana!

08:48.620 --> 08:49.590
Let's go!

08:49.590 --> 08:50.220
Yeah!

08:51.460 --> 08:54.220
What are you thinking, Santana?

08:58.500 --> 09:00.780
Santana passed the ball into the enemy's territory again!

09:00.130 --> 09:00.780
Oh no!

09:02.780 --> 09:04.740
Excellent chance for Domingo!

09:04.740 --> 09:06.060
Santana...

09:06.340 --> 09:07.540
Leo passes back!

09:07.540 --> 09:09.060
Santana gets into shooting position!

09:09.060 --> 09:12.060
But the goal is over 30 meters away!

09:17.260 --> 09:18.420
That's a...

09:18.420 --> 09:20.770
That's a Long Flying Drive Shot!

09:24.290 --> 09:26.340
Keep your eyes on the ball!

09:28.780 --> 09:30.740
Your pivoting foot isn't balanced!

09:32.010 --> 09:33.230
Not yet!

09:34.410 --> 09:36.820
Pay more attention to the ball!

09:42.020 --> 09:44.630
It's in! This is incredible!

09:44.630 --> 09:46.340
He is truly the Son of God!

09:46.340 --> 09:48.900
Santana has shown us his godly skills!

09:49.410 --> 09:53.460
Santana just did the Flying Drive Shot,

09:53.460 --> 09:56.380
the shot that took me forever to master with Roberto...

09:56.980 --> 09:58.260
3-2!

09:58.260 --> 10:02.060
Domingo is only one goal behind, thanks to Santana's 30-meter super long shot!

10:02.060 --> 10:05.480
Not only that, it was a ball that fell diagonally in front of the goal,

10:05.480 --> 10:08.860
same as Tsubasa's 2nd goal, the Flying Drive Shot!

10:08.860 --> 10:13.040
The entire stadium is in awe after what just happened!

10:15.880 --> 10:18.340
Santana, finish them off!

10:23.300 --> 10:24.410
Tsubasa...

10:25.050 --> 10:25.820
Roberto,

10:25.820 --> 10:30.330
Santana is scoring in exactly the same way as Tsubasa.

10:31.640 --> 10:34.060
Tsubasa scored the first goal with an Overhead Kick.

10:35.060 --> 10:40.060
Then, Santana scored with a Rolling Overhead Kick over Tsubasa's head.

10:41.170 --> 10:44.300
When Tsubasa scored the second goal with his Flying Drive Shot,

10:44.900 --> 10:48.380
Santana answered with a Flying Drive Shot of his own from 30 meters away.

10:48.870 --> 10:54.970
It's as if Santana is trying to prove that his technique is better than Tsubasa's!

10:55.890 --> 10:58.980
Yes, he's showing off his superior skill to Tsubasa.

11:00.430 --> 11:02.420
Carlos Santana...

11:05.210 --> 11:09.450
An amazing guy is standing in my way,

11:09.450 --> 11:11.300
Son of God, Santana.

11:16.020 --> 11:20.760
It... it was worth coming to Brazil.

11:29.070 --> 11:31.060
Domingo reduced Brancos' lead to one.

11:31.060 --> 11:32.780
They're trying to tie the match now.

11:33.580 --> 11:36.580
The stadium is cheering in Domingo's favor!

11:39.410 --> 11:41.550
I hope we won't get suppressed by this atmosphere.

11:41.550 --> 11:42.790
Don't worry, Pepe.

11:44.420 --> 11:46.560
Brancos won't lose to Domingo.

11:46.560 --> 11:47.370
What?

11:47.900 --> 11:51.130
Soccer can't be played alone.

11:51.130 --> 11:53.420
As long as Santana doesn't realize that...

11:54.600 --> 11:59.300
We, Brancos, will never lose to a team like Domingo!

12:02.050 --> 12:03.860
Leo successfully intercepts!

12:05.700 --> 12:08.130
What spectacular feinting!

12:08.130 --> 12:10.560
Santana's play is always composed.

12:11.190 --> 12:14.430
Some call him the Soccer Cyborg...

12:15.620 --> 12:18.940
Santana is no Soccer Cyborg.

12:18.940 --> 12:20.620
Absolutely not!

12:21.180 --> 12:26.340
Santana's smile was stolen by God on that day.

12:26.340 --> 12:29.340
He lost both of them at the same time.

12:29.340 --> 12:31.580
He doesn't have any relatives, does he?

12:32.110 --> 12:34.070
Idiot...

12:34.070 --> 12:36.620
Idiot!

12:37.990 --> 12:39.560
Santana!

12:52.000 --> 12:53.460
Balá-san!

12:54.000 --> 12:58.250
Carlos, become my son from now on.

12:58.250 --> 12:58.980
What?!

12:58.980 --> 13:02.980
Grandpa Ed and Grandma Catherine are my only family.

13:03.610 --> 13:05.670
They're both dead.

13:06.440 --> 13:10.540
Ed and Catherine aren't your real parents either.

13:10.540 --> 13:12.150
What?!

13:12.150 --> 13:13.290
Carlos,

13:13.290 --> 13:17.940
you were found abandoned right here on my field!

13:18.880 --> 13:19.950
No way...

13:19.950 --> 13:21.100
That can't be true!

13:21.100 --> 13:22.540
He's right!

13:22.540 --> 13:23.860
That's not true!

13:23.860 --> 13:25.410
Just ask around.

13:25.410 --> 13:28.550
All the adults in this city know about it.

13:28.550 --> 13:31.900
You've never had any family!

13:31.900 --> 13:34.860
You're all by yourself!

13:39.350 --> 13:40.860
Carlos,

13:41.300 --> 13:45.860
you only have soccer!

13:49.380 --> 13:51.380
Don't you love soccer?

13:52.430 --> 13:54.740
Don't you want to become a professional athlete?

13:57.570 --> 14:03.420
Become my son, and I'll let you keep playing soccer as much as you want!

14:03.920 --> 14:07.180
I'll get you a good coach and make you a pro!

14:07.180 --> 14:08.940
All right?

14:17.380 --> 14:19.180
Santana...

14:47.950 --> 14:50.140
Stand up! Now!

14:50.140 --> 14:53.180
Do you actually think you can become a pro like that?

14:55.030 --> 14:57.460
What are you doing to him? Aren't you being cruel!?

14:57.460 --> 15:00.460
Don't get in my way. It has nothing to do with you.

15:00.460 --> 15:06.060
This is strange. Why is Santana's training program different from the rest of the team?

15:08.060 --> 15:11.860
And Santana hasn't been coming to school!

15:11.860 --> 15:12.960
Shut up!

15:12.960 --> 15:14.770
Do you want to get beaten up?

15:16.270 --> 15:17.430
Let Leo...

15:19.240 --> 15:21.070
Let Leo go.

15:41.900 --> 15:43.910
That's it. That's the way.

15:43.910 --> 15:47.340
Become an invincible soccer player.

15:47.340 --> 15:52.150
You don't need ordinary emotions or education for that.

15:52.850 --> 15:57.110
You just need to become a great Soccer Cyborg!

16:26.300 --> 16:28.790
You're still eating?

16:31.520 --> 16:33.980
This is your training program for tomorrow.

16:41.850 --> 16:43.370
W-Why did you do that?!

16:43.370 --> 16:46.620
Don't be decorating with that crap forever!

16:46.620 --> 16:50.370
You just concentrate on soccer.

16:50.370 --> 16:53.100
You're going to become a Soccer Cyborg!

16:53.100 --> 16:55.280
Soccer Cyborg?

16:55.280 --> 16:58.570
A cyborg doesn't need feelings.

16:58.570 --> 17:01.860
A cyborg doesn't need a past either!

17:02.680 --> 17:07.170
Santana, become a Soccer Cyborg!

17:18.840 --> 17:21.760
Grandpa, Grandma...

17:21.760 --> 17:24.140
I don't want to become a cyborg.

17:27.130 --> 17:28.710
Please, God.

17:28.710 --> 17:31.230
Save me.

17:31.230 --> 17:32.940
Let me out of here!

17:36.200 --> 17:38.260
I'm here to save you, Santana!

17:38.260 --> 17:39.420
Leo!

17:39.420 --> 17:40.660
Leo!

17:40.670 --> 17:42.420
Wait there.

17:42.420 --> 17:44.420
I'll throw in the rope.

17:44.420 --> 17:45.900
Okay!

17:47.570 --> 17:49.180
Marco and others are here, too.

17:49.180 --> 17:50.040
The others are here, too?

17:50.040 --> 17:51.220
Of course!

17:51.220 --> 17:52.260
We're friends!

17:54.920 --> 17:55.540
This way.

18:01.540 --> 18:03.300
This way, Santana!

18:04.370 --> 18:05.740
Guys!

18:05.740 --> 18:08.040
Game over for the friendship play.

18:11.760 --> 18:15.220
Carlos, you've gone far enough.

18:15.220 --> 18:17.020
Go back to your room.

18:18.300 --> 18:20.120
Run, Santana!

18:20.120 --> 18:21.180
Leo!

18:27.220 --> 18:28.540
Carlos!

18:28.540 --> 18:31.620
You can't escape from me!

18:32.230 --> 18:37.650
All your friends' parents work at my factory!

18:37.650 --> 18:42.200
I can fire all their parents!

18:42.200 --> 18:43.580
Carlos!

18:44.850 --> 18:49.100
You'll end up hurting all their families if you run!

18:49.100 --> 18:50.980
Are you fine with that?

19:00.340 --> 19:05.080
He stole my parents from me, and He stole my grandpa and grandma.

19:05.080 --> 19:07.470
Now He's stealing my friends...

19:08.040 --> 19:11.060
Santana, you're my precious friend!

19:11.060 --> 19:12.820
I can't just abandon you!

19:12.820 --> 19:14.810
Let's go, Santana!

19:15.340 --> 19:16.820
Santana!

19:17.280 --> 19:21.820
You stole everything from me. Didn't you, God?

19:22.520 --> 19:28.860
God... you just want me to play soccer?

19:30.860 --> 19:32.580
Go home, guys.

19:32.580 --> 19:35.730
You guys aren't my friends anymore!

19:35.730 --> 19:36.820
Santana...

19:45.090 --> 19:47.020
Soccer Cyborg...

19:47.840 --> 19:51.710
This ball is all I need.

19:53.260 --> 19:56.340
Ever since that day, Santana has closed his heart.

20:03.260 --> 20:05.250
Santana gets into the shooting position already!

20:08.350 --> 20:10.380
Goal!

20:10.380 --> 20:12.220
3-3!

20:12.220 --> 20:15.380
Domingo has finally tied the match!

20:18.090 --> 20:21.150
He doesn't even break into a smile after scoring...

20:21.150 --> 20:24.050
Isn't soccer fun for you?

20:24.050 --> 20:26.230
If that's true...

20:27.860 --> 20:29.220
Santana!

20:29.220 --> 20:32.220
I'll teach you the joy of soccer!

20:35.820 --> 20:37.780
Teach me soccer?

20:37.780 --> 20:41.300
Did Santana just smile?

20:42.660 --> 20:44.140
Let's go, guys!

20:44.140 --> 20:45.660
Yeah!

20:46.160 --> 20:49.700
No matter how powerful and skillful you are,

20:49.700 --> 20:53.110
soccer without trusting your 
teammates around you is wrong!

20:53.110 --> 20:56.660
I won't lose to your soccer style!

20:56.660 --> 20:59.140
Tsubasa! Get in front of the goal!

21:08.910 --> 21:12.020
You said you would teach me soccer.

21:12.020 --> 21:16.940
Interesting. Then I will teach you the might of God.

21:31.030 --> 21:34.390
Your God will not answer your prayers.

21:34.390 --> 21:37.220
For the Lord taketh away, hence...

21:39.170 --> 21:45.740
your foolish prayers, your dreams, everything...

21:45.740 --> 21:48.260
shall be taken by me.

21:48.260 --> 21:50.740
Take this, Tsubasa!

22:04.020 --> 22:09.340
Preview

22:05.460 --> 22:09.620
We allowed Santana's Domingo to take the lead.

22:09.620 --> 22:13.980
The man who only believes in power and himself, Carlos Santana.

22:13.980 --> 22:16.580
I will never approve of your soccer.

22:16.580 --> 22:19.860
Soccer starts with trusting your teammates!

22:19.860 --> 22:21.380
Here we come, Santana!

22:21.380 --> 22:24.230
We'll show you the power of the Brancos!

22:24.230 --> 22:25.860
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:25.380 --> 22:34.060
The Shine of the Rosary

22:25.860 --> 22:27.410
The Shine of the Rosary

22:27.410 --> 22:28.580
Look forward to it!

22:28.580 --> 22:31.500
Let's aim for tomorrow! Get Goal!

22:37.780 --> 22:44.780
<b>Keep on going mirai ga mieta toki ni</b>

22:37.780 --> 22:44.780
<b>Keep on going, when you saw the future {"Keep on going. When you see the future,}</b>

22:37.780 --> 22:44.780
<b>Keep on going, when you saw the future</b>

22:44.780 --> 22:51.020
<b>arifureta hibi ga kagayakidasu yo</b>

22:44.780 --> 22:51.020
<b>those mundane days are shining forth {Are we not putting punctuation on the ends of lines?}</b>

22:44.780 --> 22:51.020
<b>those mundane days are shining forth</b>

22:51.020 --> 23:03.940
<b>kodou ga hazumu jikan wo kimi to tomo ni hashirou</b>

22:51.020 --> 23:03.940
<b>Our hearts are racing, so let's run together</b>

22:51.020 --> 23:03.940
<b>Our hearts are racing, so let's run together</b>

